<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>IoM Government — Sources & Uses of Funds</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #08080e;
  --surface: #0f0f18;
  --surface2: #16161f;
  --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  --border2: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  --text: #e2e2ec;
  --text-muted: #a0a0c4;
  --text-dim: #6868a0;
  --blue: #4a9eff;
  --blue-dim: rgba(74,158,255,0.15);
  --teal: #2dd4a0;
  --amber: #f5a623;
  --violet: #9b7cf4;
  --font: -apple-system,'SF Pro Display','Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;
  --mono: 'SF Mono','Fira Code',monospace;
  --radius: 6px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html,body{height:100%;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--font);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}

/* ── LAYOUT ── */
#app{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:2.5rem 1.5rem 5rem}

/* ── HEADER ── */
header{margin-bottom:2rem}
.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:.5rem}
h1{font-size:22px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:var(--text)}
h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:400}
.subtitle{margin-top:.4rem;font-size:12px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.7;max-width:600px}

/* ── CONTROLS ── */
.controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.year-pill{
  padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--border2);
  background:transparent;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:11px;font-weight:500;
  cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;font-family:var(--font);letter-spacing:.01em;
}
.year-pill:hover{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.2);color:var(--text)}
.year-pill.active{background:var(--blue-dim);border-color:rgba(74,158,255,.5);color:var(--blue)}
.year-pill .badge{
  font-size:9px;opacity:.6;margin-left:3px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.04em;
}
.ctrl-divider{width:1px;height:16px;background:var(--border);margin:0 2px;flex-shrink:0}

/* ── SANKEY ── */
#sankey-wrap{width:100%;position:relative}
#sankey-wrap svg{width:100%;overflow:visible;display:block}
.link{fill-rule:evenodd;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .12s}
.node-rect{cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .12s}
.node-rect:hover{opacity:.75}
.node-label{font-family:var(--font);fill:var(--text);font-weight:400;pointer-events:none}
.node-value{font-family:var(--font);fill:var(--text-muted);pointer-events:none}
.col-header{font-family:var(--font);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;pointer-events:none}

/* ── TOOLTIP ── */
#tt{
  position:fixed;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transition:opacity .1s;z-index:200;
  background:rgba(15,15,25,.97);border:1px solid var(--border2);
  border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.7;
  color:var(--text);max-width:210px;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
}
#tt strong{color:var(--text);font-weight:500}
#tt .tt-val{color:var(--blue);font-weight:500;font-size:13px;display:block;margin-top:1px}
#tt .tt-pct{color:var(--text-muted);font-size:10.5px}

/* ── TIME SERIES PANEL ── */
#ts-panel{
  margin-top:2rem;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;
  transition:all .25s;
}
#ts-panel.hidden{display:none}
#ts-header{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  padding:.9rem 1.2rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
#ts-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text)}
#ts-subtitle{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:2px}
#ts-close{
  background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;
  color:var(--text-muted);font-size:11px;padding:3px 9px;cursor:pointer;
  font-family:var(--font);
}
#ts-close:hover{border-color:var(--border2);color:var(--text)}
#ts-chart{padding:1.2rem}
#ts-svg{width:100%;overflow:visible}

/* ── LEGEND ── */
.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:1.2rem}
.leg-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text);cursor:default}
.leg-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;flex-shrink:0}

/* ── STOCKS PANEL ── */
#stocks-panel{margin-top:2.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:2rem}
#stocks-panel h2{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1.2rem;
  letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:10px}
.stocks-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem}
.stock-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:1rem}
.stock-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:.4rem}
.stock-value{font-size:20px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text);line-height:1.1}
.stock-sub{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:.3rem}
.stock-trend{font-size:10.5px;margin-top:.2rem}
.stock-trend.up{color:#4ade80}.stock-trend.down{color:#f87171}.stock-trend.flat{color:var(--text-muted)}

/* ── PENSION CALLOUT ── */
#pension-callout{
  margin-top:1.5rem;background:rgba(155,124,244,.06);
  border:1px solid rgba(155,124,244,.2);border-radius:8px;padding:1rem 1.2rem;
}
#pension-callout h3{font-size:11px;color:var(--violet);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:.5rem}
#pension-callout p{font-size:12px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.7}
#pension-callout strong{color:var(--text)}


.hint {
  font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:.3rem;margin-bottom:.2rem;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
  transition:opacity .4s;
}
.hint.faded { opacity:0;pointer-events:none; }

/* Info panel description */
#ts-desc { border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom:.8rem; }
/* ── SOURCE NOTE ── */
.source-note{
  margin-top:3rem;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--text-muted);
  border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:1rem;line-height:1.7;
}
.source-note a{color:var(--text-muted);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}

@media(max-width:700px){
  #app{padding:1.2rem 1rem 3rem}
  h1{font-size:18px}
  .stocks-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
}
@media(max-width:480px){.stocks-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="app">

<header>
  <p class="eyebrow">Crown Dependencies Re-Identification Observatory · Coalfinch</p>
  <h1>Isle of Man Government <em>— Sources &amp; Uses of Funds</em></h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Revenue flows from taxation and other income through to expenditure. Ribbon width is proportional to value. All figures £ million.</p>
<p class="hint" id="hint">↙ Click any node to see its trend over time and what it contains &nbsp;·&nbsp; hover ribbons to see individual flows</p>
</header>

<div class="controls" id="year-controls"></div>
<div class="controls" style="margin-top:-.8rem;margin-bottom:1.2rem" id="mode-controls"></div>

<div id="sankey-wrap"><svg id="sankey-svg"></svg></div>

<div class="legend" id="legend"></div>

<div id="ts-panel" class="hidden">
  <div id="ts-header">
    <div>
      <div id="ts-title">—</div>
      <div id="ts-subtitle">Click any node to see its trend</div>
    </div>
    <button id="ts-close" onclick="closeTS()">Close</button>
  </div>
  <div id="ts-chart"><svg id="ts-svg" height="160"></svg></div>
</div>

<div id="stocks-panel">
  <h2>Reserve stocks &amp; balance sheet context</h2>
  <div class="stocks-grid" id="stocks-grid"></div>
  <div id="pension-callout">
    <h3>Civil service pension — off-balance-sheet liability</h3>
    <p>The Pink Book shows the annual <strong>cash flow</strong>: gross pension cost less employee and employer contributions equals the revenue liability drawn each year. What it does not show is the accumulated <strong>stock</strong> of past service obligations — and the gap between the two is substantial.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:.6rem">The PSPA Unified Scheme is an unfunded defined benefit arrangement. According to the IoM Government Annual Financial Statements for the year ended March 2023, the total pension scheme liability stood at <strong>£2,902m (£2.9 billion)</strong> — equivalent to approximately <strong>50% of annual GDP</strong> at current prices. This fell from a record £4,800m in 2020-21, principally due to a £1,904m actuarial gain driven by movements in the real discount rate; the underlying obligation has not materially reduced. Treasury Minister Dr Allinson confirmed this figure in a written reply to Tynwald.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:.6rem">The government has moved <strong>new entrants</strong> to the scheme onto a defined contribution basis — a meaningful reform for the long-run trajectory — but the accumulated past service liability for existing and former members remains unfunded and absent from every headline fiscal figure published by Treasury. The first cost-sharing valuations for the unified scheme are under consideration by PSPA and Treasury.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:.6rem;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--text-muted)">Source: IoM Government Annual Financial Statements and Report, year ended March 2023 (Tynwald); written reply by Treasury Minister Dr Allinson.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p class="source-note">
  Sources: IoM Treasury Pink Books 2018-19 through 2026-27 (Tables 3A, 15, 16, 2). GDP data: Statistics IoM National Income Report 2023-24.
  2025-26 and 2026-27 are budget projections. 2020-21 NI welfare includes c.£73m COVID-related payments (Salary Support Scheme, MERA).
  Customs &amp; VAT calculated under FERSA (Final Expenditure Revenue Sharing Arrangement); current indexation based on 2018-19 survey; new survey underway.
  Published by <a href="https://observatory.coalfinch.com" target="_blank">observatory.coalfinch.com</a>.
</p>

</div><!-- /app -->
<div id="tt"></div>

<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/d3/7.8.5/d3.min.js"></script>
<script>
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
